BOLT OS — quick terminal help

Apps
  firefox              Web browser
  prismlauncher        Minecraft launcher
  winecfg              Configure Windows compatibility
  wine PROGRAM.exe     Run a Windows program
  winetricks           Install common Windows libraries
  Steam                Enable Steam Play / Proton in Settings > Compatibility
  Roblox (Sober)       Application menu shortcut; needs Vulkan

Packages
  sudo pacman -Syu                 Update BOLT OS
  sudo pacman -S firefox           Install a package
  sudo pacman -Rns PACKAGE         Remove a package
  pacman -Ss QUERY                 Search repositories
  apt help                         Apt-style command translator help

Performance
  bolt-preset status | gaming | battery
  free -h
  zramctl

BOLT uses Arch Linux. pacman is the native package manager.
